{"sections":[{"slug":"Picard群","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Picard群"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"Picard <span lang=\"zh\">群</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"Picard 群"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">空间的</span> Picard <span lang=\"zh\">群是其上</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/线丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">线丛</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的同构类关于张量积构成的群</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">复流形</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">紧复流形</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> Picard <span lang=\"zh\">群</span> $\\text{Pic}(M)$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/全纯线丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">全纯线丛</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的同构类关于张量积构成的群</span>. $\\text{Pic}(M)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的单位元是平凡丛</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">也即全纯函数层</span> $\\mathcal O_M$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $\\text{Pic}^0(M)$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $\\text{Pic}(M)$ <span lang=\"zh\">中由第一</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/陈类","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">陈类</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">等于零的线丛构成的子群</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">概形</span></h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">概形</span>"}},{"Plain":" (<span lang=\"zh\">或</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/环化空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">环化空间</span>"}},{"Plain":") $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> Picard <span lang=\"zh\">群</span> $\\operatorname{Pic}(X)$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上秩为</span> $1$ <span lang=\"zh\">的局部自由</span> $\\mathcal O_X$-<span lang=\"zh\">模的同构类在张量积下构成的群</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">它也同构于</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/平展上同调","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">平展上同调</span>"}},{"Plain":" $H^1(X_{\\mathrm{\\'et}},\\mathbb G_m)$.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">对称幺半范畴</span></h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/对称幺半范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对称幺半范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span> Picard <span lang=\"zh\">群是其中可逆对象的同构类构成的</span> Abel <span lang=\"zh\">群</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p>$\\text{Pic}(M) \\simeq H^1(M,\\mathcal O_M^*)$.</p>\n<p>$\\text{Pic}^0(M) \\simeq H^1(M,\\mathcal O_M) / H^1(M,\\mathbb{Z})$. (<span lang=\"zh\">参见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/指数序列","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">指数序列</span>"}},{"Plain":")</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Dedekind整环","text":"Dedekind <span lang=\"zh\">整环</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的谱的</span> Picard <span lang=\"zh\">群是这个环的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/理想类群","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">理想类群</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}